TCP_KEEPINTVL and TCP_KEEPCNT only appeared in the 10.8 SDK; TCP_KEEPIDLE is
already aliased to TCP_KEEPALIVE for Apple in stream-receiver.c.
Rebased for 2.12.2: the code moved from stream-receiver-connection.c.

--- src/streaming/stream-receiver.c
+++ src/streaming/stream-receiver.c
@@ -530,13 +530,17 @@
